			"date": "2024-06-14T14:21:30.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@mvsde\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mvsde</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I agree this is one of the important missing pieces for layout on the web.</p><p>WebKit is interested in it <a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/4674\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/is</span><span class=\"invisible\">sues/4674</span></a><br>Implementation tracked here <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=167335\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?i</span><span class=\"invisible\">d=167335</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112616084847186111",
			"parentId": "112615379456153446",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@simevidas/112616084754642471",
			"author": {
				"name": "Šime Vidas",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@simevidas",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/296/269/911/252/050/original/3be48f420d9991d3.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2024-06-14T17:11:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@mvsde\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mvsde</span></a></span> With overflow: scroll, the classic scrollbar track is always present, so the gutter where the track is placed into is also always present, and that’s why scrollbar-gutter: stable is not necessary. The gutter is already stable.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
